[{"id":"hamala-17-3-2","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"ponijeli smo","en":"we carried"},{"bs":"i neka ponesemo","en":"and let us carry"},{"bs":"nose ga","en":"they carry it"},{"bs":"nosim","en":"I carry"}],"ref":"17:3","answerWord":"حَمَلْنَا","answerSound":"audio/e7114c160f10acdd6946.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(They were) the seed of those whom We carried (in the ship) along with Noah. Lo! he was a grateful slave.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["ذُرِّيَّةَ","مَنْ","حَمَلْنَا","مَعَ","نُوحٍ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","عَبْدًا","شَكُورًا"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-6-31-18","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"nose","en":"they carry"},{"bs":"ponio je","en":"he/it carried"},{"bs":"nosit će","en":"he will carry"},{"bs":"bivate nošeni","en":"you (all) are carried"}],"ref":"6:31","answerWord":"يَحْمِلُونَ","answerSound":"audio/258526bcead0d89b4cd7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They indeed are losers who deny their meeting with Allah until, when the Hour cometh on them suddenly, they cry: Alas for us, that we neglected it! They bear upon their backs their burdens. Ah, evil is that which they bear!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["قَدْ","خَسِرَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِلِقَآءِ","ٱللَّهِ","حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَا","جَآءَتْهُمُ","ٱلسَّاعَةُ","بَغْتَةً","قَالُوا۟","يَٰحَسْرَتَنَا","عَلَىٰ","مَا","فَرَّطْنَا","فِيهَا","وَهُمْ","يَحْمِلُونَ","أَوْزَارَهُمْ","عَلَىٰ","ظُهُورِهِمْ","أَلَا","سَآءَ","مَا","يَزِرُونَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-6-146-15","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"ponijela je","en":"she/it carried"},{"bs":"i zaista će nositi","en":"and surely they will carry"},{"bs":"i nosi","en":"and he/it carries"},{"bs":"bivate nošeni","en":"you (all) are carried"}],"ref":"6:146","answerWord":"حَمَلَتْ","answerSound":"audio/4247977f99bad655f355.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Unto those who are Jews We forbade every animal with claws. And of the oxen and the sheep forbade We unto them the fat thereof save that upon the backs or the entrails, or that which is mixed with the bone. That we awarded them for their rebellion. And lo! we verily are truthful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["وَعَلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","هَادُوا۟","حَرَّمْنَا","كُلَّ","ذِى","ظُفُرٍ","وَمِنَ","ٱلْبَقَرِ","وَٱلْغَنَمِ","حَرَّمْنَا","عَلَيْهِمْ","شُحُومَهُمَآ","إِلَّا","مَا","حَمَلَتْ","ظُهُورُهُمَآ","أَوِ","ٱلْحَوَايَآ","أَوْ","مَا","ٱخْتَلَطَ","بِعَظْمٍ","ذَٰلِكَ","جَزَيْنَٰهُم","بِبَغْيِهِمْ","وَإِنَّا","لَصَٰدِقُونَ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-20-100-4","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"nosit će","en":"he will carry"},{"bs":"da ponesu","en":"so that they may carry"},{"bs":"ponijeli smo vas","en":"we carried you (all)"},{"bs":"ponijela je","en":"she/it carried"}],"ref":"20:100","answerWord":"يَحْمِلُ","answerSound":"audio/5e2e11ecde8a5567cbd1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whoso turneth away from it, he verily will bear a burden on the Day of Resurrection,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["مَّنْ","أَعْرَضَ","عَنْهُ","فَإِنَّهُۥ","يَحْمِلُ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","وِزْرًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-23-22-3","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"bivate nošeni","en":"you (all) are carried"},{"bs":"ponijela ga je","en":"she/it carried him"},{"bs":"i podignuta je","en":"and she/it was lifted"},{"bs":"ponijeli smo vas","en":"we carried you (all)"}],"ref":"23:22","answerWord":"تُحْمَلُونَ","answerSound":"audio/52d6e6f1adcf051d8eb6.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And on them and on the ship ye are carried.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["وَعَلَيْهَا","وَعَلَى","ٱلْفُلْكِ","تُحْمَلُونَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-31-14-3","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"ponijela ga je","en":"she/it carried him"},{"bs":"i nosi","en":"and he/it carries"},{"bs":"i neka ponesemo","en":"and let us carry"},{"bs":"i zaista će nositi","en":"and surely they will carry"}],"ref":"31:14","answerWord":"حَمَلَتْهُ","answerSound":"audio/1a945c30c8fd1c0d627d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We have enjoined upon man concerning his partners - His mother beareth him in weakness upon weakness, and his weaning is in two years - Give thanks unto Me and unto thy parents. Unto Me is the journeying.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["وَوَصَّيْنَا","ٱلْإِنسَٰنَ","بِوَٰلِدَيْهِ","حَمَلَتْهُ","أُمُّهُۥ","وَهْنًا","عَلَىٰ","وَهْنٍ","وَفِصَٰلُهُۥ","فِى","عَامَيْنِ","أَنِ","ٱشْكُرْ","لِى","وَلِوَٰلِدَيْكَ","إِلَىَّ","ٱلْمَصِيرُ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-9-92-11","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"nosim vas","en":"I carry you (all)"},{"bs":"i ponio ga je","en":"and he/it carried it"},{"bs":"ukrcaj!","en":"load!"},{"bs":"nose ga","en":"they carry it"}],"ref":"9:92","answerWord":"أَحْمِلُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/8ca8bd6a180e5fddfff0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Nor unto those whom, when they came to thee (asking) that thou shouldst mount them, thou didst tell: I cannot find whereon to mount you. They turned back with eyes flowing with tears, for sorrow that they could not find the means to spend.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["وَلَا","عَلَى","ٱلَّذِينَ","إِذَا","مَآ","أَتَوْكَ","لِتَحْمِلَهُمْ","قُلْتَ","لَآ","أَجِدُ","مَآ","أَحْمِلُكُمْ","عَلَيْهِ","تَوَلَّوا۟","وَّأَعْيُنُهُمْ","تَفِيضُ","مِنَ","ٱلدَّمْعِ","حَزَنًا","أَلَّا","يَجِدُوا۟","مَا","يُنفِقُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-11-40-7","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"ukrcaj!","en":"load!"},{"bs":"ponijeli smo","en":"we carried"},{"bs":"natovario si ga","en":"you laid it"},{"bs":"nose ga","en":"they carry it"}],"ref":"11:40","answerWord":"ٱحْمِلْ","answerSound":"audio/68b02e9f96a7bd6074be.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(Thus it was) till, when Our commandment came to pass and the oven gushed forth water, We said: Load therein two of every kind, a pair (the male and female), and thy household, save him against whom the word hath gone forth already, and those who believe. And but a few were they who believed with him.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَا","جَآءَ","أَمْرُنَا","وَفَارَ","ٱلتَّنُّورُ","قُلْنَا","ٱحْمِلْ","فِيهَا","مِن","كُلٍّ","زَوْجَيْنِ","ٱثْنَيْنِ","وَأَهْلَكَ","إِلَّا","مَن","سَبَقَ","عَلَيْهِ","ٱلْقَوْلُ","وَمَنْ","ءَامَنَ","وَمَآ","ءَامَنَ","مَعَهُۥٓ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلٌ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-12-36-14","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"nosim","en":"I carry"},{"bs":"nose ga","en":"they carry it"},{"bs":"nose","en":"they carry"},{"bs":"pa ga je nosila","en":"so she carried him"}],"ref":"12:36","answerWord":"أَحْمِلُ","answerSound":"audio/b6912c67a2d07b95cbcd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And two young men went to prison with him. One of them said: I dreamed that I was pressing wine. The other said: I dreamed that I was carrying upon my head bread whereof the birds were eating. Announce unto us the interpretation, for we see thee of those good (at interpretation).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["وَدَخَلَ","مَعَهُ","ٱلسِّجْنَ","فَتَيَانِ","قَالَ","أَحَدُهُمَآ","إِنِّىٓ","أَرَىٰنِىٓ","أَعْصِرُ","خَمْرًا","وَقَالَ","ٱلْءَاخَرُ","إِنِّىٓ","أَرَىٰنِىٓ","أَحْمِلُ","فَوْقَ","رَأْسِى","خُبْزًا","تَأْكُلُ","ٱلطَّيْرُ","مِنْهُ","نَبِّئْنَا","بِتَأْوِيلِهِۦٓ","إِنَّا","نَرَىٰكَ","مِنَ","ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ"],"marked":[14],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-16-25-0","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"da ponesu","en":"so that they may carry"},{"bs":"natovario si ga","en":"you laid it"},{"bs":"nose ga","en":"they carry it"},{"bs":"bivate nošeni","en":"you (all) are carried"}],"ref":"16:25","answerWord":"لِيَحْمِلُوٓا۟","answerSound":"audio/0788ca8f3a268f5f45fa.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"That they may bear their burdens undiminished on the Day of Resurrection, with somewhat of the burdens of those whom they mislead without knowledge. Ah! evil is that which they bear!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["لِيَحْمِلُوٓا۟","أَوْزَارَهُمْ","كَامِلَةً","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","وَمِنْ","أَوْزَارِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يُضِلُّونَهُم","بِغَيْرِ","عِلْمٍ","أَلَا","سَآءَ","مَا","يَزِرُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-17-70-4","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"i ponijeli smo ih","en":"and we carried them"},{"bs":"ponijeli smo vas","en":"we carried you (all)"},{"bs":"i nosi","en":"and he/it carries"},{"bs":"i podignuta je","en":"and she/it was lifted"}],"ref":"17:70","answerWord":"وَحَمَلْنَٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/0b92adc518f3a7e4da1f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Verily we have honoured the Children of Adam. We carry them on the land and the sea, and have made provision of good things for them, and have preferred them above many of those whom We created with a marked preferment.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","كَرَّمْنَا","بَنِىٓ","ءَادَمَ","وَحَمَلْنَٰهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْبَرِّ","وَٱلْبَحْرِ","وَرَزَقْنَٰهُم","مِّنَ","ٱلطَّيِّبَٰتِ","وَفَضَّلْنَٰهُمْ","عَلَىٰ","كَثِيرٍ","مِّمَّنْ","خَلَقْنَا","تَفْضِيلًا"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-19-22-0","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"pa ga je nosila","en":"so she carried him"},{"bs":"i nosi","en":"and he/it carries"},{"bs":"ponio je","en":"he/it carried"},{"bs":"ponijeli smo vas","en":"we carried you (all)"}],"ref":"19:22","answerWord":"فَحَمَلَتْهُ","answerSound":"audio/00fdc89ddadbfb095ed0.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And she conceived him, and she withdrew with him to a far place.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["فَحَمَلَتْهُ","فَٱنتَبَذَتْ","بِهِۦ","مَكَانًا","قَصِيًّا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-20-111-7","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"ponio je","en":"he/it carried"},{"bs":"i ponijeli smo ih","en":"and we carried them"},{"bs":"da ponesu","en":"so that they may carry"},{"bs":"nosim vas","en":"I carry you (all)"}],"ref":"20:111","answerWord":"حَمَلَ","answerSound":"audio/d255325b97628273f30b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And faces humble themselves before the Living, the Eternal. And he who beareth (a burden of) wrongdoing is indeed a failure (on that day).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["وَعَنَتِ","ٱلْوُجُوهُ","لِلْحَىِّ","ٱلْقَيُّومِ","وَقَدْ","خَابَ","مَنْ","حَمَلَ","ظُلْمًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-29-12-7","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"i neka ponesemo","en":"and let us carry"},{"bs":"ponijela je","en":"she/it carried"},{"bs":"i zaista će nositi","en":"and surely they will carry"},{"bs":"i nosi","en":"and he/it carries"}],"ref":"29:12","answerWord":"وَلْنَحْمِلْ","answerSound":"audio/ad5ccf4caf57831b628c.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who disbelieve say unto those who believe: Follow our way (of religion) and we verily will bear your sins (for you). They cannot bear aught of their sins. Lo! they verily are liars.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["وَقَالَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","لِلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوا۟","ٱتَّبِعُوا۟","سَبِيلَنَا","وَلْنَحْمِلْ","خَطَٰيَٰكُمْ","وَمَا","هُم","بِحَٰمِلِينَ","مِنْ","خَطَٰيَٰهُم","مِّن","شَىْءٍ","إِنَّهُمْ","لَكَٰذِبُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-29-13-0","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"i zaista će nositi","en":"and surely they will carry"},{"bs":"ponijela ga je","en":"she/it carried him"},{"bs":"nosit će","en":"he will carry"},{"bs":"ponijeli smo","en":"we carried"}],"ref":"29:13","answerWord":"وَلَيَحْمِلُنَّ","answerSound":"audio/e5d33079f04e1bc91879.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"But they verily will bear their own loads and other loads beside their own, and they verily will be questioned on the Day of Resurrection concerning that which they invented.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["وَلَيَحْمِلُنَّ","أَثْقَالَهُمْ","وَأَثْقَالًا","مَّعَ","أَثْقَالِهِمْ","وَلَيُسْـَٔلُنَّ","يَوْمَ","ٱلْقِيَٰمَةِ","عَمَّا","كَانُوا۟","يَفْتَرُونَ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-33-72-9","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"nose ga","en":"they carry it"},{"bs":"i nosi","en":"and he/it carries"},{"bs":"bivate nošeni","en":"you (all) are carried"},{"bs":"i neka ponesemo","en":"and let us carry"}],"ref":"33:72","answerWord":"يَحْمِلْنَهَا","answerSound":"audio/40711603258e593fbf2e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We offered the trust unto the heavens and the earth and the hills, but they shrank from bearing it and were afraid of it. And man assumed it. Lo! he hath proved a tyrant and a fool.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["إِنَّا","عَرَضْنَا","ٱلْأَمَانَةَ","عَلَى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَٱلْجِبَالِ","فَأَبَيْنَ","أَن","يَحْمِلْنَهَا","وَأَشْفَقْنَ","مِنْهَا","وَحَمَلَهَا","ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","ظَلُومًا","جَهُولًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-33-72-12","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"i ponio ga je","en":"and he/it carried it"},{"bs":"nose ga","en":"they carry it"},{"bs":"nose","en":"they carry"},{"bs":"i podignuta je","en":"and she/it was lifted"}],"ref":"33:72","answerWord":"وَحَمَلَهَا","answerSound":"audio/5b24bdf9e3a838a72312.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We offered the trust unto the heavens and the earth and the hills, but they shrank from bearing it and were afraid of it. And man assumed it. Lo! he hath proved a tyrant and a fool.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["إِنَّا","عَرَضْنَا","ٱلْأَمَانَةَ","عَلَى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَٱلْجِبَالِ","فَأَبَيْنَ","أَن","يَحْمِلْنَهَا","وَأَشْفَقْنَ","مِنْهَا","وَحَمَلَهَا","ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","ظَلُومًا","جَهُولًا"],"marked":[12],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-54-13-0","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"i ponijeli smo ga","en":"and we carried him"},{"bs":"ponio je","en":"he/it carried"},{"bs":"da ponesu","en":"so that they may carry"},{"bs":"i ponijeli smo ih","en":"and we carried them"}],"ref":"54:13","answerWord":"وَحَمَلْنَٰهُ","answerSound":"audio/25a3bbec60b1e7aee0a5.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We carried him upon a thing of planks and nails,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["وَحَمَلْنَٰهُ","عَلَىٰ","ذَاتِ","أَلْوَٰحٍ","وَدُسُرٍ"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-62-5-6","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"nose ga","en":"they carry it"},{"bs":"ponijeli smo vas","en":"we carried you (all)"},{"bs":"natovario si ga","en":"you laid it"},{"bs":"ponijela je","en":"she/it carried"}],"ref":"62:5","answerWord":"يَحْمِلُوهَا","answerSound":"audio/01f7ede9e282e7ccc370.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The likeness of those who are entrusted with the Law of Moses, yet apply it not, is as the likeness of the ass carrying books. Wretched is the likeness of folk who deny the revelations of Allah. And Allah guideth not wrongdoing folk.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["مَثَلُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","حُمِّلُوا۟","ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ","ثُمَّ","لَمْ","يَحْمِلُوهَا","كَمَثَلِ","ٱلْحِمَارِ","يَحْمِلُ","أَسْفَارًۢا","بِئْسَ","مَثَلُ","ٱلْقَوْمِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَذَّبُوا۟","بِـَٔايَٰتِ","ٱللَّهِ","وَٱللَّهُ","لَا","يَهْدِى","ٱلْقَوْمَ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"hamala-69-11-4","words":["verb:hamala"],"options":[{"bs":"ponijeli smo vas","en":"we carried you (all)"},{"bs":"ukrcaj!","en":"load!"},{"bs":"i ponio ga je","en":"and he/it carried it"},{"bs":"da ponesu","en":"so that they may carry"}],"ref":"69:11","answerWord":"حَمَلْنَٰكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/3eeecd90aadc9fee15c2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! when the waters rose, We carried you upon the ship","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"nositi, ponijeti","en":"to carry, to bear"},"passage":["إِنَّا","لَمَّا","طَغَا","ٱلْمَآءُ","حَمَلْنَٰكُمْ","فِى","ٱلْجَارِيَةِ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"حَمَلَ"}},{"id":"walla-17-46-15","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okrenuli su se","en":"they turned"},{"bs":"okreću","en":"they turn"},{"bs":"okrenuo ih je","en":"he/it turned them"},{"bs":"pa okrenite!","en":"so (you all) turn!"}],"ref":"17:46","answerWord":"وَلَّوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/92722b2232eb7900b6a4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And We place upon their hearts veils lest they should understand it, and in their ears a deafness; and when thou makest mention of thy Lord alone in the Qur'an, they turn their backs in aversion.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["وَجَعَلْنَا","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِهِمْ","أَكِنَّةً","أَن","يَفْقَهُوهُ","وَفِىٓ","ءَاذَانِهِمْ","وَقْرًا","وَإِذَا","ذَكَرْتَ","رَبَّكَ","فِى","ٱلْقُرْءَانِ","وَحْدَهُۥ","وَلَّوْا۟","عَلَىٰٓ","أَدْبَٰرِهِمْ","نُفُورًا"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-27-10-7","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okrenuo se","en":"he/it turned"},{"bs":"okrenuo ih je","en":"he/it turned them"},{"bs":"zaista će se okrenuti","en":"surely they will turn"},{"bs":"okreće im leđa","en":"he/it turns (his back) to them"}],"ref":"27:10","answerWord":"وَلَّىٰ","answerSound":"audio/c699ce672029ca03ac63.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And throw down thy staff! But when he saw it writhing as it were a demon, he turned to flee headlong; (but it was said unto him): O Moses! Fear not! the emissaries fear not in My presence,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["وَأَلْقِ","عَصَاكَ","فَلَمَّا","رَءَاهَا","تَهْتَزُّ","كَأَنَّهَا","جَآنٌّ","وَلَّىٰ","مُدْبِرًا","وَلَمْ","يُعَقِّبْ","يَٰمُوسَىٰ","لَا","تَخَفْ","إِنِّى","لَا","يَخَافُ","لَدَىَّ","ٱلْمُرْسَلُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-2-142-5","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okrenuo ih je","en":"he/it turned them"},{"bs":"pa okrenite!","en":"so (you all) turn!"},{"bs":"okrenuli bi se","en":"they would turn"},{"bs":"okreću","en":"they turn"}],"ref":"2:142","answerWord":"وَلَّىٰهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/08e10a09833f403faef1.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The foolish of the people will say: What hath turned them from the qiblah which they formerly observed? Say: Unto Allah belong the East and the West. He guideth whom He will unto a straight path.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["سَيَقُولُ","ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ","مِنَ","ٱلنَّاسِ","مَا","وَلَّىٰهُمْ","عَن","قِبْلَتِهِمُ","ٱلَّتِى","كَانُوا۟","عَلَيْهَا","قُل","لِّلَّهِ","ٱلْمَشْرِقُ","وَٱلْمَغْرِبُ","يَهْدِى","مَن","يَشَآءُ","إِلَىٰ","صِرَٰطٍ","مُّسْتَقِيمٍ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-3-111-6","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okreću vam leđa","en":"they turn (their backs) to you (all)"},{"bs":"pa okrenite!","en":"so (you all) turn!"},{"bs":"zaista će se okrenuti","en":"surely they will turn"},{"bs":"postavljamo","en":"we set over"}],"ref":"3:111","answerWord":"يُوَلُّوكُمُ","answerSound":"audio/64a95c33ce982ade9146.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They will not harm you save a trifling hurt, and if they fight against you they will turn and flee. And afterward they will not be helped.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["لَن","يَضُرُّوكُمْ","إِلَّآ","أَذًى","وَإِن","يُقَٰتِلُوكُمْ","يُوَلُّوكُمُ","ٱلْأَدْبَارَ","ثُمَّ","لَا","يُنصَرُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-4-115-13","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okrećemo ga","en":"we turn him"},{"bs":"okrenuli bi se","en":"they would turn"},{"bs":"zaista će se okrenuti","en":"surely they will turn"},{"bs":"okreće im leđa","en":"he/it turns (his back) to them"}],"ref":"4:115","answerWord":"نُوَلِّهِۦ","answerSound":"audio/25f23ba5dc96ed42cc1e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whoso opposeth the messenger after the guidance (of Allah) hath been manifested unto him, and followeth other than the believer's way, We appoint for him that unto which he himself hath turned, and expose him unto hell - a hapless journey's end!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["وَمَن","يُشَاقِقِ","ٱلرَّسُولَ","مِنۢ","بَعْدِ","مَا","تَبَيَّنَ","لَهُ","ٱلْهُدَىٰ","وَيَتَّبِعْ","غَيْرَ","سَبِيلِ","ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","نُوَلِّهِۦ","مَا","تَوَلَّىٰ","وَنُصْلِهِۦ","جَهَنَّمَ","وَسَآءَتْ","مَصِيرًا"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-6-129-1","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"postavljamo","en":"we set over"},{"bs":"okrećete se","en":"you (all) turn"},{"bs":"i okrenut će","en":"and they will turn"},{"bs":"okrenuo ih je","en":"he/it turned them"}],"ref":"6:129","answerWord":"نُوَلِّى","answerSound":"audio/98bba519b5f3b8dc5a4d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Thus We let some of the wrong-doers have power over others because of what they are wont to earn.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["وَكَذَٰلِكَ","نُوَلِّى","بَعْضَ","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ","بَعْضًۢا","بِمَا","كَانُوا۟","يَكْسِبُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-8-15-9","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okrećete im leđa","en":"you (all) turn (your backs) to them"},{"bs":"okrenuli su se","en":"they turned"},{"bs":"pa okreni!","en":"so turn!"},{"bs":"okreću","en":"they turn"}],"ref":"8:15","answerWord":"تُوَلُّوهُمُ","answerSound":"audio/4f80fd0547f58edd5050.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O ye who believe! When ye meet those who disbelieve in battle, turn not your backs to them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["يَٰٓأَيُّهَا","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُوٓا۟","إِذَا","لَقِيتُمُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","زَحْفًا","فَلَا","تُوَلُّوهُمُ","ٱلْأَدْبَارَ"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-8-16-1","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okreće im leđa","en":"he/it turns (his back) to them"},{"bs":"okrenuli ste","en":"you (all) turned"},{"bs":"pa okrenite!","en":"so (you all) turn!"},{"bs":"okrećete se","en":"you (all) turn"}],"ref":"8:16","answerWord":"يُوَلِّهِمْ","answerSound":"audio/461c3605f4060d55bd58.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Whoso on that day turneth his back to them, unless manoeuvring for battle or intent to join a company, he truly hath incurred wrath from Allah, and his habitation will be hell, a hapless journey's end.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["وَمَن","يُوَلِّهِمْ","يَوْمَئِذٍ","دُبُرَهُۥٓ","إِلَّا","مُتَحَرِّفًا","لِّقِتَالٍ","أَوْ","مُتَحَيِّزًا","إِلَىٰ","فِئَةٍ","فَقَدْ","بَآءَ","بِغَضَبٍ","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَمَأْوَىٰهُ","جَهَنَّمُ","وَبِئْسَ","ٱلْمَصِيرُ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-9-25-21","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okrenuli ste","en":"you (all) turned"},{"bs":"okrećete im leđa","en":"you (all) turn (your backs) to them"},{"bs":"okreću vam leđa","en":"they turn (their backs) to you (all)"},{"bs":"i okrenut će","en":"and they will turn"}],"ref":"9:25","answerWord":"وَلَّيْتُم","answerSound":"audio/9a9fe398de1d523757db.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Allah hath given you victory on many fields and on the day of Huneyn, when ye exulted in your multitude but it availed you naught, and the earth, vast as it is, was straitened for you; then ye turned back in flight;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["لَقَدْ","نَصَرَكُمُ","ٱللَّهُ","فِى","مَوَاطِنَ","كَثِيرَةٍ","وَيَوْمَ","حُنَيْنٍ","إِذْ","أَعْجَبَتْكُمْ","كَثْرَتُكُمْ","فَلَمْ","تُغْنِ","عَنكُمْ","شَيْـًٔا","وَضَاقَتْ","عَلَيْكُمُ","ٱلْأَرْضُ","بِمَا","رَحُبَتْ","ثُمَّ","وَلَّيْتُم","مُّدْبِرِينَ"],"marked":[21],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-9-57-7","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okrenuli bi se","en":"they would turn"},{"bs":"okrećete im leđa","en":"you (all) turn (your backs) to them"},{"bs":"okrenuli ste","en":"you (all) turned"},{"bs":"i okrenut će","en":"and they will turn"}],"ref":"9:57","answerWord":"لَّوَلَّوْا۟","answerSound":"audio/e1791c33f2823fd870de.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Had they but found a refuge, or caverns, or a place to enter, they surely had resorted thither swift as runaways.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["لَوْ","يَجِدُونَ","مَلْجَـًٔا","أَوْ","مَغَٰرَٰتٍ","أَوْ","مُدَّخَلًا","لَّوَلَّوْا۟","إِلَيْهِ","وَهُمْ","يَجْمَحُونَ"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-33-15-7","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okreću","en":"they turn"},{"bs":"postavljamo","en":"we set over"},{"bs":"pa okrenite!","en":"so (you all) turn!"},{"bs":"okreću vam leđa","en":"they turn (their backs) to you (all)"}],"ref":"33:15","answerWord":"يُوَلُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/47ca4c6d8fc01caf2eb8.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And verily they had already sworn unto Allah that they would not turn their backs (to the foe). An oath to Allah must be answered for.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["وَلَقَدْ","كَانُوا۟","عَٰهَدُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","مِن","قَبْلُ","لَا","يُوَلُّونَ","ٱلْأَدْبَٰرَ","وَكَانَ","عَهْدُ","ٱللَّهِ","مَسْـُٔولًا"],"marked":[7],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-40-33-1","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"okrećete se","en":"you (all) turn"},{"bs":"okrenuo ih je","en":"he/it turned them"},{"bs":"pa okrenite!","en":"so (you all) turn!"},{"bs":"okreću vam leđa","en":"they turn (their backs) to you (all)"}],"ref":"40:33","answerWord":"تُوَلُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/1b9a71157b3e799a05bc.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"A day when ye will turn to flee, having no preserver from Allah: and he whom Allah sendeth astray, for him there is no guide.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["يَوْمَ","تُوَلُّونَ","مُدْبِرِينَ","مَا","لَكُم","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","مِنْ","عَاصِمٍ","وَمَن","يُضْلِلِ","ٱللَّهُ","فَمَا","لَهُۥ","مِنْ","هَادٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-54-45-2","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"i okrenut će","en":"and they will turn"},{"bs":"okreću vam leđa","en":"they turn (their backs) to you (all)"},{"bs":"pa okrenite!","en":"so (you all) turn!"},{"bs":"okreće im leđa","en":"he/it turns (his back) to them"}],"ref":"54:45","answerWord":"وَيُوَلُّونَ","answerSound":"audio/6cc42fd03af96e66455f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"The hosts will all be routed and will turn and flee.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["سَيُهْزَمُ","ٱلْجَمْعُ","وَيُوَلُّونَ","ٱلدُّبُرَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"walla-59-12-11","words":["verb:walla"],"options":[{"bs":"zaista će se okrenuti","en":"surely they will turn"},{"bs":"okrećemo ga","en":"we turn him"},{"bs":"okrenuli bi se","en":"they would turn"},{"bs":"okrenuo ih je","en":"he/it turned them"}],"ref":"59:12","answerWord":"لَيُوَلُّنَّ","answerSound":"audio/e34b5335acf75b132b6f.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"(For) indeed if they are driven out they go not out with them, and indeed if they are attacked they help them not, and indeed if they had helped them they would have turned and fled, and then they would not have been victorious.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"okrenuti, postaviti","en":"to turn, to appoint"},"passage":["لَئِنْ","أُخْرِجُوا۟","لَا","يَخْرُجُونَ","مَعَهُمْ","وَلَئِن","قُوتِلُوا۟","لَا","يَنصُرُونَهُمْ","وَلَئِن","نَّصَرُوهُمْ","لَيُوَلُّنَّ","ٱلْأَدْبَٰرَ","ثُمَّ","لَا","يُنصَرُونَ"],"marked":[11],"facts":{"verb":"وَلَّى"}},{"id":"azama-2-227-1","words":["verb:azama"],"options":[{"bs":"odluče se na","en":"they resolve on"},{"bs":"odlučio si","en":"you resolved"},{"bs":"odlučeno je","en":"is decided"},{"bs":"odlučujete","en":"you (all) resolve"}],"ref":"2:227","answerWord":"عَزَمُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/921baf014c2f1adfa159.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if they decide upon divorce (let them remember that) Allah is Hearer, Knower.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlučiti, čvrsto se odlučiti","en":"to resolve, to be determined"},"passage":["وَإِنْ","عَزَمُوا۟","ٱلطَّلَٰقَ","فَإِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","سَمِيعٌ","عَلِيمٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"عَزَمَ"}},{"id":"azama-3-159-22","words":["verb:azama"],"options":[{"bs":"odlučio si","en":"you resolved"},{"bs":"odlučujete","en":"you (all) resolve"},{"bs":"odluče se na","en":"they resolve on"},{"bs":"odlučeno je","en":"is decided"}],"ref":"3:159","answerWord":"عَزَمْتَ","answerSound":"audio/ad1d8990ee6d37abd617.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"It was by the mercy of Allah that thou wast lenient with them (O Muhammad), for if thou hadst been stern and fierce of heart they would have dispersed from round about thee. So pardon them and ask forgiveness for them and consult with them upon the conduct of affairs. And when thou art resolved, then put thy trust in Allah. Lo! Allah loveth those who put their trust (in Him).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlučiti, čvrsto se odlučiti","en":"to resolve, to be determined"},"passage":["فَبِمَا","رَحْمَةٍ","مِّنَ","ٱللَّهِ","لِنتَ","لَهُمْ","وَلَوْ","كُنتَ","فَظًّا","غَلِيظَ","ٱلْقَلْبِ","لَٱنفَضُّوا۟","مِنْ","حَوْلِكَ","فَٱعْفُ","عَنْهُمْ","وَٱسْتَغْفِرْ","لَهُمْ","وَشَاوِرْهُمْ","فِى","ٱلْأَمْرِ","فَإِذَا","عَزَمْتَ","فَتَوَكَّلْ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يُحِبُّ","ٱلْمُتَوَكِّلِينَ"],"marked":[22],"facts":{"verb":"عَزَمَ"}},{"id":"azama-47-21-4","words":["verb:azama"],"options":[{"bs":"odlučeno je","en":"is decided"},{"bs":"odluče se na","en":"they resolve on"},{"bs":"odlučujete","en":"you (all) resolve"},{"bs":"odlučio si","en":"you resolved"}],"ref":"47:21","answerWord":"عَزَمَ","answerSound":"audio/285b82724460a6b465d9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Obedience and a civil word. Then, when the matter is determined, if they are loyal to Allah it will be well for them.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odlučiti, čvrsto se odlučiti","en":"to resolve, to be determined"},"passage":["طَاعَةٌ","وَقَوْلٌ","مَّعْرُوفٌ","فَإِذَا","عَزَمَ","ٱلْأَمْرُ","فَلَوْ","صَدَقُوا۟","ٱللَّهَ","لَكَانَ","خَيْرًا","لَّهُمْ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"عَزَمَ"}}]